  ('ws_quest', ARRAY['window_seat']::text[], ARRAY['solo']::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 13, false, 'The dish with a story', 'Order one dish tied to a legend, festival or historical figure. Photograph it and tell its origin story.', 'Many famous dishes were born from war, poverty or royalty. | insight: Recipes travel with migrants and traders — a dish''s ingredients trace an old route. | budget: Under $10 | keywords: dish origin story {destination}, traditional dishes {destination}', '{}'::text[], NULL, '{}'::text[], 'candidate:security_missions', '1b6b2639-2f08-4ed6-8ce1-e14ba47b5a79', false, 'Window Seat daily quest (R-351)'),
  ('ws_quest', ARRAY['window_seat']::text[], ARRAY['solo']::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 13, false, 'How people get around', 'Ride or observe one local way of getting around (boat, tuk-tuk, tram, scooter taxi). Photograph it and explain how fares work.', 'Transport shows how a city moves and earns. | insight: Transport choices follow geography, income and city planning decisions. | budget: Under $5 | keywords: public transport {destination}, local transport history {destination}', '{}'::text[], NULL, '{}'::text[], 'candidate:security_missions', '21275da3-2604-406a-a307-f5e665f2ae28', false, 'Window Seat daily quest (R-351)'),
  ('ws_quest', ARRAY['window_seat']::text[], ARRAY['solo']::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 13, false, 'Sweet test', 'Try a local dessert or sweet snack and photograph it. Describe the main ingredient and why it''s popular here.', 'Desserts reveal what a region grows and celebrates. | insight: Sugar, rice, coconut or honey in desserts often reflect old plantation and trade history. | budget: Under $5 | keywords: traditional desserts {destination}, street sweets {destination}', '{}'::text[], NULL, '{}'::text[], 'candidate:security_missions', '309304a9-8134-4f31-b463-231853933121', false, 'Window Seat daily quest (R-351)'),
  ('ws_quest', ARRAY['window_seat']::text[], ARRAY['solo']::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 13, false, 'The sign you couldn''t read', 'Photograph a public sign you can''t read, then work out what it says. Write the translation and why it''s there.', 'Signs are free lessons in grammar, rules and humor. | insight: Public signs show what a city worries about — from queues to quiet hours. | budget: Free | keywords: common signs {destination}, {destination} script basics', '{}'::text[], NULL, '{}'::text[], 'candidate:security_missions', '3d28fddf-1533-4bd4-ba72-5e03cec389e5', false, 'Window Seat daily quest (R-351)'),
  ('ws_quest', ARRAY['window_seat']::text[], ARRAY['solo']::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 13, false, 'A wall that remembers', 'Find a building, plaque or street name in {destination} tied to a historical event. Photograph it and write the event in two sentences.', 'Cities keep their memory in stone, paint and street names. | insight: Street names change when history changes — renaming is how a country rewrites its story. | budget: Free | keywords: historic plaque {destination}, street names history {destination}', '{}'::text[], NULL, '{}'::text[], 'candidate:security_missions', '4903b381-12eb-4527-9bee-5fb07f6397ff', false, 'Window Seat daily quest (R-351)'),
  ('ws_quest', ARRAY['window_seat']::text[], ARRAY['solo']::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 13, false, 'The landmark from the side', 'Visit a world-famous landmark in today''s city and photograph it from an angle nobody uses. Write one detail most visitors walk past.', 'The famous view hides the interesting details. | insight: Builders hid symbols, repairs and signatures that tell the landmark''s real story. | budget: Free unless the site charges entry | keywords: {destination} landmark history, hidden details {destination} landmark', '{}'::text[], NULL, '{}'::text[], 'candidate:security_missions', '4dffc77b-77a8-4a3f-88c0-8339eea1580e', false, 'Window Seat daily quest (R-351)'),
  ('ws_quest', ARRAY['window_seat']::text[], ARRAY['solo']::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 13, false, 'Why the city sits here', 'Find a viewpoint, river or hill and work out why {destination} grew right there. Photograph the view and explain the reason.', 'Cities are where trade, water and defense meet. | insight: Most old cities sit on a river crossing, a harbor or a trade route. | budget: Free | keywords: history of {destination} founding, geography {destination}', '{}'::text[], NULL, '{}'::text[], 'candidate:security_missions', '5694adf4-521d-4214-9e1d-33dd8bd063bb', false, 'Window Seat daily quest (R-351)'),
  ('ws_quest', ARRAY['window_seat']::text[], ARRAY['solo']::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 13, false, 'Street art meaning', 'Find a mural, carving or public artwork and photograph it. Find out who made it or what it represents.', 'Public art is the city talking to itself. | insight: Murals often mark protests, celebrations or neighborhood identity. | budget: Free | keywords: street art {destination}, public art {destination}', '{}'::text[], NULL, '{}'::text[], 'candidate:security_missions', '626de53a-61d2-4d01-a115-1e31d7968b50', false, 'Window Seat daily quest (R-351)'),
  ('ws_quest', ARRAY['window_seat']::text[], ARRAY['solo']::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 13, false, 'Sit where locals sit', 'Find a bench, café or step where locals pause. Stay 15 minutes, photograph the view and write three things you noticed.', 'Slowing down is how you see a city''s rhythm. | insight: City rhythm — lunch hours, rest times, rush hours — follows climate and work culture. | budget: Free or one drink under $5 | keywords: local cafés {destination}, people-watching spots {destination}', '{}'::text[], NULL, '{}'::text[], 'candidate:security_missions', '6ffbb091-2ec2-4151-b892-74434f317051', false, 'Window Seat daily quest (R-351)'),
  ('ws_quest', ARRAY['window_seat']::text[], ARRAY['solo']::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 13, false, 'Three words that open doors', 'Learn three polite phrases in the local language and use each one for real today. Write down the reaction each one got.', 'A greeting in someone''s own language changes the tone of almost any exchange. | insight: Politeness words reveal what a culture values most — respect for age, time or hospitality. | budget: Free | keywords: basic phrases {destination}, polite greetings {destination} language', '{}'::text[], NULL, '{}'::text[], 'candidate:security_missions', '802a2be0-f342-4c59-b896-6f7c8a30e10f', false, 'Window Seat daily quest (R-351)'),
  ('ws_quest', ARRAY['window_seat']::text[], ARRAY['solo']::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 13, false, 'Built for the weather', 'Spot one design built for the local climate — shutters, roofs, stilts, shade cloths. Photograph it and explain how it works.', 'Architecture solves climate problems with simple physics. | insight: Steep roofs shed rain, thick walls store cool air and stilts beat floods — physics in brick. | budget: Free | keywords: traditional architecture {destination}, climate design {destination}', '{}'::text[], NULL, '{}'::text[], 'candidate:security_missions', '88ad9f8d-d855-42cd-932c-8c565d7ad0f7', false, 'Window Seat daily quest (R-351)'),
  ('ws_quest', ARRAY['window_seat']::text[], ARRAY['solo']::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 13, false, 'Made from what''s around', 'Find a craft or everyday object made from a local material (wood, clay, fiber, stone). Photograph it and explain why that material.', 'Crafts grow from what the land provides. | insight: Materials follow geography: bamboo in humid places, stone where wood is scarce. | budget: Free to look, souvenirs under $15 | keywords: traditional crafts {destination}, local materials {destination} craft', '{}'::text[], NULL, '{}'::text[], 'candidate:security_missions', '8d1db2ad-6bf4-4aac-9caa-b44b47a4c921', false, 'Window Seat daily quest (R-351)'),
  ('ws_quest', ARRAY['window_seat']::text[], ARRAY['solo']::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 13, false, 'The local game', 'Find out which sport or game people here really play or watch. Watch a few minutes (in person or on a screen in a café) and photograph the setting.', 'Sports reveal community, rivalry and pride. | insight: Many traditional games began as training for work, hunting or festivals. | budget: Free | keywords: popular sports {destination}, traditional games {destination}', '{}'::text[], NULL, '{}'::text[], 'candidate:security_missions', 'a686c442-d8e2-4b7e-a2d7-eba7a3092664', false, 'Window Seat daily quest (R-351)'),
  ('ws_quest', ARRAY['window_seat']::text[], ARRAY['solo']::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 13, false, 'The rule nobody told you', 'Find one etiquette rule visitors often miss here — shoes, queues, tipping, chopsticks, hands. Show where you saw it and how you followed it.', 'Knowing the unwritten rules is the fastest way to be welcomed. | insight: Etiquette usually protects something practical — hygiene, time or respect for elders. | budget: Free | keywords: etiquette tips {destination}, cultural do and dont {destination}', '{}'::text[], NULL, '{}'::text[], 'candidate:security_missions', 'af8562a4-afdd-4861-891c-e938e1c01b73', false, 'Window Seat daily quest (R-351)'),
  ('ws_quest', ARRAY['window_seat']::text[], ARRAY['solo']::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 13, false, 'A song from here', 'Find one song by an artist from this country, listen to it somewhere meaningful and photograph that spot. Write what the lyrics or rhythm are about.', 'Music is a shortcut to how people feel about home. | insight: Popular music often carries regional instruments and rhythms into modern charts. | budget: Free | keywords: famous musicians {destination}, popular songs {destination}', '{}'::text[], NULL, '{}'::text[], 'candidate:security_missions', 'affee840-6cf0-4691-87fa-152cb19f90f6', false, 'Window Seat daily quest (R-351)'),
  ('ws_quest', ARRAY['window_seat']::text[], ARRAY['solo']::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 13, false, 'Green corner', 'Find a park, garden or tree that matters to locals. Photograph it and write why people value it.', 'Green spaces often hold community history. | insight: Many old trees and gardens are protected because of a story, belief or historic event. | budget: Free | keywords: parks {destination}, sacred trees {destination}', '{}'::text[], NULL, '{}'::text[], 'candidate:security_missions', 'b8ba8313-4205-4d9f-a00f-37cc469a9fea', false, 'Window Seat daily quest (R-351)'),
  ('ws_quest', ARRAY['window_seat']::text[], ARRAY['solo']::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 13, false, 'Late-night snack science', 'Try a snack people here eat late at night and photograph it. Find out why it became the late-night choice.', 'Late-night food is comfort food, and it tells you what a city craves. | insight: Late-night dishes are usually cheap, fast and filling — built for shift workers. | budget: Under $5 | keywords: late night food {destination}, night snacks {destination}', '{}'::text[], NULL, '{}'::text[], 'candidate:security_missions', 'b949dfb3-1c1c-4a4a-84db-d204db9dec6c', false, 'Window Seat daily quest (R-351)'),
  ('ws_quest', ARRAY['window_seat']::text[], ARRAY['solo']::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 13, false, 'The everyday ritual', 'Notice a small ritual locals repeat — an offering, a gesture, how they greet or pay. Photograph the objects involved (not people without asking) and explain it respectfully.', 'Daily rituals are quiet cultural facts hiding in plain sight. | insight: Rituals often blend old beliefs with modern life, and their meaning shifts across generations. | budget: Free | keywords: customs {destination}, etiquette {destination}', '{}'::text[], NULL, '{}'::text[], 'candidate:security_missions', 'bb70d072-216e-4bcd-bdc9-efc6f7abc00e', false, 'Window Seat daily quest (R-351)'),
  ('ws_quest', ARRAY['window_seat']::text[], ARRAY['solo']::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 13, false, 'The city after dark', 'Explore a lively, safe area after sunset — a night market, lit square or riverside. Photograph the light and describe how the place changes at night.', 'Many cities live a second life after dark. | insight: Night markets often began where heat made daytime trading hard. | budget: Free to wander, snacks under $5 | keywords: night market {destination}, evening walk {destination}', '{}'::text[], NULL, '{}'::text[], 'candidate:security_missions', 'be9a25d1-47b5-475a-b1ea-13ca343ed277', false, 'Window Seat daily quest (R-351)'),
  ('ws_quest', ARRAY['window_seat']::text[], ARRAY['solo']::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 13, false, 'The souvenir that''s actually used', 'Find something locals buy for daily use (not a tourist souvenir) for under $15. Photograph it and explain what it''s for.', 'Everyday objects say more about a place than fridge magnets. | insight: Daily-use objects show climate, cooking habits and design traditions. | budget: Under $15 | keywords: everyday items {destination}, local shopping {destination}', '{}'::text[], NULL, '{}'::text[], 'candidate:security_missions', 'c070695c-5956-43cb-bccf-371f98bce3f8', false, 'Window Seat daily quest (R-351)'),
  ('ws_quest', ARRAY['window_seat']::text[], ARRAY['solo']::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 13, false, 'Bargain or fixed?', 'Find out whether bargaining is expected where you shop. Photograph the market or shop and write how prices work there.', 'Price customs differ by country, city and even street. | insight: Bargaining is common where prices are not printed and sellers know their regulars. | budget: Free | keywords: bargaining etiquette {destination}, markets {destination}', '{}'::text[], NULL, '{}'::text[], 'candidate:security_missions', 'c241849a-5b70-4047-b7fb-91369e869fbe', false, 'Window Seat daily quest (R-351)'),
  ('ws_quest', ARRAY['window_seat']::text[], ARRAY['solo']::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 13, false, 'Look down', 'Spend 20 minutes noticing only what''s underfoot — tiles, drains, paving, markings. Photograph the best one and explain it.', 'Overlooked details show how a city is built and maintained. | insight: Utility covers and paving patterns are often designed with local symbols. | budget: Free | keywords: manhole covers {destination}, street tiles {destination}', '{}'::text[], NULL, '{}'::text[], 'candidate:security_missions', 'dc64e17e-fddf-4ea8-9a09-2161f22dea80', false, 'Window Seat daily quest (R-351)'),
  ('ws_quest', ARRAY['window_seat']::text[], ARRAY['solo']::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 13, false, 'The market color test', 'Walk a fresh market and photograph one fruit, spice or vegetable you''ve never seen. Find out its name and how locals use it.', 'Markets are living encyclopedias of a region''s food. | insight: Market produce maps the climate — what grows here and what is imported. | budget: Under $5 | keywords: local fruits {destination}, market guide {destination}', '{}'::text[], NULL, '{}'::text[], 'candidate:security_missions', 'e19ccb9e-4979-4bdb-82d2-c0274a9af032', false, 'Window Seat daily quest (R-351)'),
  ('ws_quest', ARRAY['window_seat']::text[], ARRAY['solo']::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 13, false, 'What a dollar buys here', 'Spend the local equivalent of about one US dollar on the best thing you can find. Photograph it and compare it with home.', 'Small purchases explain prices, wages and daily life faster than any chart. | insight: Economists use cheap everyday items to compare what money is really worth between countries. | budget: About $1 | keywords: cost of living {destination}, cheap local snacks {destination}', '{}'::text[], NULL, '{}'::text[], 'candidate:security_missions', 'ea7ec4d5-aa0a-482a-b202-882834712b26', false, 'Window Seat daily quest (R-351)'),
  ('ws_quest', ARRAY['window_seat']::text[], ARRAY['solo']::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 13, false, 'Scene from a film', 'Find a place in {destination} that appears in, or feels like, a well-known film or show from or about this country. Recreate the shot and say which scene.', 'Film shapes how the world imagines a place — sometimes accurately, sometimes not. | insight: Film tourism can transform a neighborhood''s economy within a few years. | budget: Free | keywords: films set in {destination}, famous directors {destination}', '{}'::text[], NULL, '{}'::text[], 'candidate:security_missions', 'eb4bf5f6-9c12-42f4-a311-73e249371334', false, 'Window Seat daily quest (R-351)'),
